From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:21:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 866/867] wifi: mt6797: group the state of one firmware
 lifetime

Move what lasts as long as the phy to the front of struct mt6797_mac: the
locks, the queues and work items, mac80211's interface, bands and
channels, and the settings mac80211 gives once (the power-save wish and
the signal threshold). The rest, one firmware lifetime's state, becomes
the lifetime struct group, so that a WLAN restart can start it from zero
while the phy stays registered.

No functional change.
